tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:1:13: error: `result` is the returned value in `ensures`
  |
1 | def f(x: m, result: m) -> m:
  |             ^^^^^^ this parameter has the same name
  = help: rename the parameter, so `ensures` can refer to both

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:2:16: error: cannot compare length and dimensionless
  |
2 |     requires x >= 0
  |                ^^ mismatched dimensions
  |              - length
  |                   - dimensionless
  = note: both operands of `>=` must have the same dimension
  = note: `x` is a length because it is the parameter `x: m` (line 1)
  = help: these differ by a factor of length: `x` is `0` times a length

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:3:14: error: `requires` needs a Bool condition, found Scalar [L]
  |
3 |     requires x
  |              ^ not a Bool
  = note: v0.1 has no truthiness
  = help: compare it instead, e.g. `x != 0 m`

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:8:14: error: `result` is not available in `requires`
  |
8 |     requires result > 0 m
  |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^ `result` is only the returned value inside `ensures`
  = help: state what the result must satisfy in an `ensures` line

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:9:20: error: cannot compare length and time
  |
9 |     ensures result > 0 s
  |                    ^ mismatched dimensions
  |             ------ length
  |                      --- time
  = note: both operands of `>` must have the same dimension
  = help: convert one side, or fix the unit

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:10:13: error: cannot find `y` in this scope
   |
10 |     ensures y > 0 m
   |             ^ not defined
   = help: an `ensures` sees the parameters as passed and `result`, not the function's locals

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:15:13: error: `h` returns no value, so there is no `result`
   |
15 |     ensures result > 0 m
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^ `result` is the returned value
   = help: return a value, or state the postcondition about the arguments

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:18:8: error: `assert` needs a Bool condition, found Scalar [L]
   |
18 | assert 3 m
   |        ^^^ not a Bool
   = note: v0.1 has no truthiness
   = help: compare it instead, e.g. `3 m != 0 m`

tests/ui/check/err_contracts.sky:19:8: error: cannot find `undefined_name` in this scope
